      1972, item 175 (the next word with as many 1 bits)
 \see F. Gray, Pulse code communication, U.S. Patent 2,632,058, 1953
 \see W. Mula, N. Kurz, D. Lemire, Faster population counts using AVX2
      instructions, The Computer Journal 61(1), 111-120, 2018,
      doi:10.1093/comjnl/bxx046
 \see S. Vigna, Broadword implementation of rank/select queries, WEA
      2008, LNCS 5038, 154-168, doi:10.1007/978-3-540-68552-4_12
 \see B. R. Heap, Permutations by interchanges, The Computer Journal 6(3),
      293-298, 1963, doi:10.1093/comjnl/6.3.293
 \see R. Sedgewick, Permutation generation methods, ACM Computing Surveys
      9(2), 137-164, 1977, doi:10.1145/356689.356692
 \see H. F. Trotter, Algorithm 115: Perm, Communications of the ACM 5(8),
